# Content-agent secrets and working files.
#
# `.env.local` holds the Gemini key and the Google OAuth credentials. It is
# read only by `agents/shared/config.mjs`, which nothing in `src/` imports, so
# none of it can reach the PWA bundle — the app is a static export that makes
# no request to anything but its own assets.
#
# `.state/` caches extracted curriculum text and `.drafts/` holds generated
# drafts. Both are a teacher's material before anyone has approved it, and
# neither belongs in the repository or in `public/`.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
agents/.state/
agents/.drafts/
